---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
const story = [
  { label: 'Tech', year: '2005', title: 'I start in tech.', text: "By 2005 I'm editing video in Adobe Premiere, running Google Ads, reading Google Analytics and running my own eBay business. Crypto is still 7 years away." },
  { label: 'GE Healthcare', year: 'Fortune 500', title: 'Marketing at GE Healthcare.', text: 'Earlier in my career I did marketing at GE Healthcare and presented to leadership at a Fortune 500 company.' },
  { label: 'COO', year: '6 years', title: 'I ran a company.', text: '6 years as COO of a national education company that ran summer camps. I was the main speaker and the main negotiator. When COVID sent everyone home, the camps stopped, and that chapter closed.' },
  { label: 'Crypto', year: '2012', title: 'I get into crypto.', text: 'I start mining Bitcoin in 2012. In 2013 I add Dogecoin and Litecoin. That is 9 years before Action Crypto exists.' },
  { label: 'YouTube', year: '2021', title: 'I start Action Crypto.', text: "My takes on AI, DePIN and crypto. 1.6M+ views and 20.7K subscribers later, I'm still at it. In 2022 I join Genzio as host and live programming lead." },
  { label: 'DePIN Day', year: '2024, 2025', title: 'I build events.', text: 'DePIN Day: Seattle. I co-organized it and hosted it, 2 years running. T-Mobile, HP and Borderless Capital on stage across 2024 and 2025. 65,000+ viewers on the X livestream. Same stretch, I host livestreams for Karate Combat.' },
  { label: 'LFG', year: 'Now', title: 'Partner at Laissez-Faire Group.', text: "I'm a Partner and the Chief Communications Officer. Go-to-market strategy, marketing and communications sit with me, and I host the founder interviews on LFG Action. I'm also live every Friday on Action Items." },
];
const steps = story.map((s) => ({ label: s.label, rule: '#0A2C52', color: '#8A9099' }));
---
<Base page="about">
<Header current="About" />
<header style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: stretch">
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px) clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 24px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(40px, 5.4vw, 80px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -0.035em; text-wrap: balance">I ran a company. Then I started a channel.</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 520px; font-size: 19px; color: #D5D8DB">I'm Action. I've worked in tech since 2005 and been in crypto since 2012. For 6 years I was a COO, the main speaker and the main negotiator.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 460px; min-width: 0; position: relative; min-height: 560px">
<picture style="display: contents"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/studio-smile-800.avif 800w, /img/studio-smile-1156.avif 1156w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1600px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/img/studio-smile-800.webp 800w, /img/studio-smile-1156.webp 1156w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 1600px"><img src="/img/studio-smile.jpg" width="1156" height="650" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="Action smiling at his desk in the studio" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 45% 30%"></picture>
</div>
</header>

<section class="rv" aria-label="Why I break things down" style="padding: clamp(72px, 9vw, 140px) clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px)">
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 1180px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(26px, 3.6vw, 52px); line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -0.03em; text-wrap: pretty">Breaking things down so everyone can follow matters more than people think. It was my job as a COO. It's my job now.</p>
</section>

<section class="rv" aria-label="My story" data-story style="padding: 0 clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px) 120px; scroll-margin-top: 16px">
<div style="border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px; padding-top: 40px">
<div role="group" aria-label="Pick a chapter" style="flex: 1 1 220px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2px">
{steps.map((st, i) => (<Fragment>
<button type="button" data-step={i} aria-pressed={i === 0 ? "true" : "false"} style={`background: none; border: 0; border-left: 3px solid ${st.rule}; padding: 12px 0 12px 16px; min-height: 44px; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: ${st.color}`}>{st.label}</button>
</Fragment>))}
</div>
<div style="flex: 3 1 480px; min-width: 0; min-height: 340px">
{story.map((c, i) => (<Fragment>
<div class="stepin" data-panel={i} style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<div style="font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 132px); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.045em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums">{c.year}</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(24px, 2.6vw, 36px); letter-spacing: -0.02em">{c.title}</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB">{c.text}</p>
</div>
</Fragment>))}
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div style="overflow: clip">
<picture style="display: contents"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/depin-chestup-800.avif 800w, /img/depin-chestup-1456.avif 1456w" sizes="100vw"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/img/depin-chestup-800.webp 800w, /img/depin-chestup-1456.webp 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="/img/depin-chestup.jpg" width="1456" height="813" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="par"  alt="Action on stage at DePIN Day: Seattle, holding a microphone" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: clamp(300px, 40vw, 580px); object-fit: cover; object-position: 50% 30%"></picture>
</div>

<section class="rv" aria-label="Today" style="padding: 110px clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px); display: flex; flex-direction: column">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Day job</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB">I'm a Partner and the Chief Communications Officer at Laissez-Faire Group. Go-to-market strategy, marketing and communications sit with me, for teams in Web3, DePIN, fintech and decentralized AI. If you're launching, that's who you call. <a href="/lfg" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF">Work with LFG</a></p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">On camera</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB">2 channels. {SITE.channel} is me and my opinions. LFG Action is me asking founders and builders the questions. 989 videos between them. <a href={SITE.youtube} rel="noopener" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF">Subscribe to {SITE.channel}</a> or <a href="/shows" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF">see all the shows</a></p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid #0A2C52; border-bottom: 1px solid #0A2C52">
<h2 style="margin: 0; flex: 1 1 220px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px">Home base</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; flex: 3 1 480px; max-width: 760px; font-size: 20px; color: #D5D8DB">San Diego, California.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="rv" id="talk" style="background: #002346; padding: 110px clamp(20px, 4.5vw, 64px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; max-width: 1000px; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.8vw, 68px); line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.035em">That's the story. The videos are better.</h2>
<a href={SITE.youtube} rel="noopener" style="align-self: flex-start; font-family: 'Montserrat', Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 32px); padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 3px solid #69BE28">Watch {SITE.channel}</a>
<a href="/contact" style="align-self: flex-start; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF">I host and I speak. Book me for your stage or your show.</a>
</section>
</Base>
